<title>USA: Newton, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Newton, Iowa, won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $2.495 million of Newton, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.22 percent.</p>
</text>
